    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n38 Spencer's Court is an impressive 2 double bed (main ensuite) penthouse apartment in a wonderful setting within very close proximity to Enniscorthy town centre.\n Spencer's Court is a small quiet private neighbourhood in a safe community. It's very well kept and maintained and offers good parking. It is within walking distance of the town centre schools, shops, sportsgrounds, restaurants, and pubs and only 5 km from the N11.\n This wonderful property offers two spacious bedrooms (main ensuite), and the home extends to 70 sq mts approx. There is a great sense of space and light throughout.\nOn entry you are immediately impressed by the well-designed large living space with lovely views over the green area, each rooms lends itself to amazing views.\nThis modern home will suit the first-time buyer or investor looking for a beautiful residence in a safe community, in the extremely popular area of Enniscorthy. \nIt's ready for immediate occupation.\nView and be impressed!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.51 x 1.17m\nWith wooden flooring.\n\nReception Room - 4.98m x 3.41m\nLight filled room that boasts large windows that over looks a green area, very comfortable sitting area with dining section off and doors off to balcony.\n\nKitchen - 3.47m x 1.83m\nWith a good array of fitted kitchen units, cooker, washer/dryer and fridge included int he sale.\n\nRear Hall - 6.30m x 1.18m\nWith wooden flooring and large hotpress/storage room off.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.39m x 3.43m\nSpacious double room with lovely views to Vinegar Hill, built-in wardrobes and door off to\n\nEnsuite - 2.29m x 1.88\nWith shower, wc & WHB.\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.30m x 3.40m\nDouble room with buit-in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.50m x 2.27m\nWith bath, wc and whb and good tiling.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Penthouse apartment approx. 70 sq. mts.</li><li>Ready for immediate occupation. </li><li>Excellent location a short walk to all amenities.</li><li>Good parking.</li><li>With a modern and stylish feel.</li><li>Electric heating.</li><li>Management fee 1720 to include block insurance, refuse collection and maintenance of communal areas. Mains water and sewage.</li><li>All contents included.</ul>"
      },
      {
